desc: Extract function names into a list
category: ex
par: 20
hint1: Global command + delete what you don't need
hint2: :v (inverse global) deletes non-matching lines; :%norm applies keys to every line
solution: :v/^d/d<CR>:%norm 4xf(D<CR>
note: :v/^d/d deletes lines NOT starting with 'd'; :%norm runs keys on each survivor:
note: 4x strips 'def ', f( jumps to '(', D deletes to end — leaving just the name.
--- START ---
def initialize(config):
    pass

def process_data(input, output):
    pass

def validate(schema):
    pass

def cleanup():
    pass
--- GOAL ---
initialize
process_data
validate
cleanup
--- END ---
